    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-A",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Dyrnwyn OmniMech is built around a single ER PPC in the center torso, aided by additional heat sinks. A Nova CEWS takes care of electronic warfare, while a Remote Sensor Dispenser allows the MechWarrior to monitor vital areas. Its jump jets and Partial Wing System let it reach good firing positions quickly, a level of mobility that demands considerable skill from its pilot to exploit fully.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
